{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mock Open Banking Lab",
    "description": "Requests for the mock Open Banking authorization server (`mock-lab`, default `http://127.0.0.1:8000`).\n\n**Import** this collection and `Mock_Lab.postman_environment.json`.\n\n**Client auth in Postman.** Seeded `private_key_jwt` keys are generated at process start and are not exported. The happy-path folder therefore turns on `ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH` and uses `test-client` / `test-secret`. Reset the lab when you are done.\n\n**PKCE** uses the RFC 7636 appendix B verifier/challenge pair (same values as `mock-lab/tests/test_pkce.py`).\n\n**Resources.** Access tokens issued without DPoP or mTLS have an empty `cnf`. `/accounts` and friends fail sender-constraint checks unless `RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY` is enabled. The happy-path folder sets that toggle before calling the resource APIs.\n\n**Collection runner.** Run folders in order: Lab control → Happy path. End with Reset lab config.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "request_uri", "value": "" },
    { "key": "auth_code", "value": "" },
    { "key": "access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "dcr_client_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "registration_access_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Lab control",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get lab config",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 and toggles object', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.toggles).to.be.an('object');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.toggles).to.have.property('METADATA_ENABLED');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reload lab config from .env",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().toggles).to.be.an('object');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/reload"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patch toggle — ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH true",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('toggle applied', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().toggles.ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH\",\n  \"value\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patch toggle — RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY true",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('toggle applied', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().toggles.RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY\",\n  \"value\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patch toggle — PAR_ENFORCED false",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"PAR_ENFORCED\",\n  \"value\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Patch toggle — unknown key (expect 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400 unknown toggle', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.include('Unknown toggle');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"NOT_A_TOGGLE\",\n  \"value\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset lab config",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config/reset"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Discovery",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Authorization server metadata",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 metadata', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.issuer).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.authorization_endpoint).to.include('/authorize');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.token_endpoint).to.include('/token');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.jwks_uri).to.include('/jwks');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "JWKS",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 keys', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.keys).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.keys[0].kty).to.eql('EC');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/jwks"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OpenAPI JSON",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/openapi.json"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Dynamic client registration",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register without initial access token (expect 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.include('initial access token');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"redirect_uris\": [\"https://dcr.example/callback\"],\n  \"token_endpoint_auth_method\": \"private_key_jwt\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register with initial access token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 registered client', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.client_id).to.match(/^dcr-/);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.registration_access_token).to.be.a('string').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('dcr_client_id', body.client_id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('registration_access_token', body.registration_access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{initial_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"redirect_uris\": [\"https://dcr.example/callback\"],\n  \"token_endpoint_auth_method\": \"private_key_jwt\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update client without registration access token (expect 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"redirect_uris\": [\"https://dcr.example/new\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/register/{{dcr_client_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update client with registration access token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 updated', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().redirect_uris).to.include('https://dcr.example/new');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{registration_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"redirect_uris\": [\"https://dcr.example/new\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/register/{{dcr_client_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Happy path (PAR → token → resource)",
      "description": "Run this folder top to bottom. It enables client-secret auth and RS blind trust so Postman can complete the flow without signing JWTs or DPoP proofs. Reset lab config afterwards.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Enable ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('weak client auth on', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().toggles.ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"ALLOW_WEAK_CLIENT_AUTH\",\n  \"value\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Enable RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('RS blind trust on', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().toggles.RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"key\": \"RS_TRUSTS_AS_BLINDLY\",\n  \"value\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. PAR (client secret)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('PAR issued', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.request_uri).to.include('urn:ietf:params:oauth:request_uri:');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.expires_in).to.be.a('number');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('request_uri', body.request_uri);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirect_uri}}" },
                { "key": "scope", "value": "{{scope}}" },
                { "key": "code_challenge", "value": "{{code_challenge}}" },
                { "key": "code_challenge_method", "value": "S256" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/par"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Authorize with request_uri",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('authorization code issued', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.code).to.be.a('string').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.redirect).to.include(pm.environment.get('redirect_uri'));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('auth_code', body.code);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/authorize?client_id={{client_id}}&request_uri={{request_uri}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Token (authorization_code + PKCE)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('access token issued', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.token_type).to.eql('Bearer');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', body.access_token);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "authorization_code" },
                { "key": "code", "value": "{{auth_code}}" },
                { "key": "redirect_uri", "value": "{{redirect_uri}}" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}" },
                { "key": "code_verifier", "value": "{{code_verifier}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Introspect token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('active token', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.active).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(body.client_id).to.eql(pm.environment.get('client_id'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}" },
                { "key": "token_type_hint", "value": "access_token" },
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{client_id}}" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{client_secret}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/introspect"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. GET /resource",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('resource ok', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/resource"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "8. GET /accounts",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('accounts', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.accounts).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.expect(body.accounts[0].account_id).to.eql('acc-001');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/accounts"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "9. GET /transactions",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('transactions', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().transactions).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/transactions"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "10. Reset lab config",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lab/config/reset"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
